===2.25-litre diesel (Engine Code 10J)===
{{Infobox automobile engine
|name=2.25-litre diesel
|configuration=Inline-4 cylinders
|block=Cast iron
|head=cast iron
|valvetrain=OHV, chain drive camshaft, push-rod operated
|displacement={{cvt|2286|cc|L cc cuin|1|order=out}}
|bore={{cvt|90.47|mm|in}}
|stroke={{cvt|88.9|mm|in}}
|compression=23.0:1
|fueltype=Diesel
|fuelsystem=CAV DPA rotary pump and CAV Pintaux injectors
|power={{cvt|62|hp}} at 4,000&nbsp;rpm
|torque={{cvt|103|lbft|Nm|0}} at 1,800&nbsp;rpm
